  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(A=A^T\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left(\\begin{array}{cc}\n3 & x-1 \\\\\n2 x+3 & x+2\n\\end{array}\\right)=\\left(\\begin{array}{cc}\n3 & 2 x+3 \\\\\nx-1 & x+2\n\\end{array}\\right) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow x-1=2 x+3 \\text { or } x=-4\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
